<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-INDIA 174-1 V SRI LANKA - TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 174-1 V SRI LANKA - TEA.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were 174 for one at tea on the opening day of the first test against Sri Lanka in Colombo on Saturday.</p>
<p>Score: India 174-1 (N.Sidhu 103 not out, R.Dravid 58 not out)</p>
